<h1>{{ __('Refinement Prompts', 'treetank-trans') }}</h1>
<div class="prompt-refinement-template-settings">
    <p>
        <small>
            {{ __('These prompts are sent to the assistant and workflow refinement UIs as editable defaults. System prompts and prompt templates are rendered with the same Twig variables for their role. Leave a field empty to use the built-in prompt. Twig variables must be preserved exactly.', 'treetank-trans') }}
